@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Manifest Validation
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Vapor.toml Intake" as Read
rectangle "File Role Check" as Roles
rectangle "Dependency Ref Check" as Deps
rectangle "Kernel Ref Check" as Kernels
rectangle "Diagnostics" as Diag
rectangle "Approved Build Input" as Approve

Read --> Roles : supplies manifests for
Roles --> Deps : admits valid roles to
Deps --> Kernels : admits valid deps to
Kernels --> Approve : admits valid kernels to
Roles --> Diag : reports bad file role to
Deps --> Diag : reports bad dependency to
Kernels --> Diag : reports bad kernel ref to
@enduml
